      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOMEBUSH DIVA (3) is having her first start around this course. Scored last start (22.76) at Ascot Park over 390m. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. MR. KIA ORA (7) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 1.5 lengths second (24.28) over 425m at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. GALLOPING JESSIE (5) has a strong record here with six wins and two placings from 13 starts. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (24.20) in a Grade 5 over 425m at this track. Can feature in the finish. HAY RILEY (2) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when second (25.04) in a Grade 5 over 435m at Sale.",
